iclr-2026-0853a1e684f7,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 10,31,图像内容为 MM-Warmup 消融；p.29 正文按 Figure 10 指向 MM-Warmup，p.31 caption 却写成 reflection process。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|226.45,qualitative_grid|image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure 10: Qualitative results of the reflection process. Without reflection (first row), an ill- planned action (”Rubs the surface”) causes object inconsistency. With reflection (second row), the model revises its plan to a more logical action, ensuring consistency.",38,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,1,0,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,9.963,9.963,color,8,#5D6A4A|#7C875E|#3C3B32|#A7A783|#95A076|#8A9368|#82402E|#8E7055,0.6505,,,
