iclr-2026-09d94b8d6d44,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 45,29,COCO source/target object-order ID estimation 与 target intervention protocol,double_column,90.00|146.02|522.00|452.90,conceptual_diagram|image_montage,1,3,1,"Figure 45: Illustration of the intervention performed with the COCO dataset. In this section, we verify that the use of position IDs generalizes to real-world images. Importantly, in contrast to the experiments conducted in the main sections, for real-world spatial arrangements we do not know the assignment of IDs to objects in the image. We hypothesized that the ID assignment order would be reflected by the order in which objects were enumerated in an open-ended scene description task. Accordingly, we obtained an ordering for the objects in an image based on the order in which the model described these objects, and then used this ordering to perform an intervention (Figure 45).",111,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,ArialMT|CourierNew-Bold|Arial-BoldMT,5.802,7.777,8.703,color,8,#91A546|#BDD3E4|#9FB5AC|#563728|#5E5444|#627363|#C3A07D|#3E4241,0.4945,,,
