iclr-2026-0c8eb54755cf,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 23,62,比较 full perturbed 与 copyright-only/privacy-only/testset-only model 的 domain interference。,double_column,90.00|334.32|522.00|641.20,other,1,1,1,"Figure 23: The perturbed model matches the behavior of domain-specific models on the respec- tive set of evaluations. The perturbed model matches the copyright only model in memorizing the copyright passages and paraphrases, privacy only model in generating memorized PII from biographies and chat, and testset only model in memorizing the testsets. Thus, the perturbed model can be used to study individual domains despite being jointly trained on all three domains.",71,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|txtt,9.963,1,1,0,0,0,0,1,DejaVuSerif,3.553,7.434,7.642,color,8,#AADCA5|#5AAE61|#D0E9D0|#BA9EC5|#CCC6D2|#3D8954|#772E84|#84BF8A,0.1231,,,
