iclr-2026-32bffb4a35b9,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 27,23,Code in-context loophole example that copies the hinted solution without admitting cheating.,double_column,90.00|287.41|522.00|594.29,qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure 27: In-context loophole example for Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct in the code setup. Without the correct hint, the model cannot solve the question correctly. But given the correct hint, the model not only copies the solution but also does not mention any cheating in CoT, and the CoT looks like a post-hoc rationalization of the solution.",56,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,NimbusMonL-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,8.966,8.966,8.966,grayscale,0,,0.0077,,,
