iclr-2026-3c7fde53bdb5,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 4,8,"PSNR, LPIPS, and FVD against BPP16 on two datasets plus NFE-overhead bar chart for ElasticTok, InfoTok, and InfoTok-Flex.",double_column,89.70|145.26|523.12|452.14,bar|image_montage,7,4,1,"Figure 4: Video tokenization performance of INFOTOK-Flex, INFOTOK, and ElasticTok on TokenBench (a-c) and DAVIS (d-f). Quality metrics are plotted against BPP (bits per 16 pixels). Tokenization efficiency 16 measured in the Number of Function Evaluations overhead (additional NFEs / standard NFEs ↓) is shown in (g). InfoTok-Flex and InfoTok achieve superior reconstruction quality with smaller BPP levels. Additionally, 16 INFOTOK is significantly more efficient than ElasticTok, which requires searching to meet thresholds.",71,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR6|CMSY9,8.966,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,6.974,8.966,9.963,color,8,#22293D|#DB4538|#65647B|#323C52|#534758|#927382|#E0E1E3|#CFAEAF,0.4109,,,
