iclr-2026-4019795d726c,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,ablation,main,Figure 4,8,(a) APAVA accuracy、inference time、memory bubbles；(b) PTB Gaussian noise intensity 与 F1 曲线。,double_column,90.00|235.96|522.00|542.84,line,2,2,1,Figure 4: (a): Efficiency and Effectiveness analysis of TeCh and other baselines on APAVA dataset with batch size B = 128. ‘#’ stands for ‘former’ to save space. (b): Robustness of attention and CoTAR to noise when using Channel or Temporal embedding. We consistently increase the intensity β (the standard deviation) of Gaussian random noise from 0.0 to 20.0 on the last channel of the PTB dataset. F1-Score is used to quantify the change.,74,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR10|NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal|CMMI10,9.963,0,1,0,1,1,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMSY7|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal,5.496,7.852,9.963,color,8,#EBE4D9|#E8C4AE|#BC838A|#C85258|#818BD6|#6DBD94|#D49887|#C1DECE,0.1804,,,
