iclr-2026-4826a74c05ee,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,NQ-Open 与 ARC-Challenge 上 61 个模型的 direct/TBT 平行排名；CI 约束的 greedy alignment 展示显著排名变化。,double_column,89.64|20.00|523.65|249.90,other,1,1,1,"Figure 1: Rankings of 61 language models on two question-answering benchmarks: Natural Ques- tions Open and ARC Challenge. Top: Direct evaluation leads to inconsistent rankings. Although both benchmarks test for question-answering ability, the resulting model rankings show substantial disagreement. Bottom: Train-before-test aligns model rankings. Note: For each of the two plots, we greedily align model rankings as much as possible without violating confidence intervals, thus revealing only those ranking changes that are statistically significant. See Appendix C.1.",78,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,0,1,1,1,1,1,4,ArialMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,3.975,4.655,9.963,color,8,#97CAC1|#C8A9AB|#A7A79C|#BBD1C9|#61ACA0|#E9DFDF|#E4C9C7|#DD85A6,0.8023,,,
iclr-2026-4826a74c05ee,ICLR,oral,replication_200,table,experimental_design,main,Table 1,4,LU、CR、QA、PBC、Math、Med 六类及 24 个 benchmark。,double_column,89.25|430.36|523.66|681.80,table,1,2,1,"Benchmark selection. We begin our Table 1: We categorize benchmarks into language un- study with the lm-eval-harness pack- derstanding (LU), commonsense reasoning (CR), ques- age (Gao et al., 2023), which offers a com- tion answering (QA), physics/biology/chemistry (PBC), prehensive suite of language model bench- math (Math), and medicine (Med). marks. To accommodate the train-before- test methodology which requires a dedi- Category Benchmarks cated training set for fine-tuning, we first LU MNLI,QNLI,RTE,CoLA,SST-2,MRPC,QQP,WiC,ANLI identify benchmarks that provide at least CR Winogrande,CommonsenseQA,Hellaswag,Social-IQA 1,000 training examples. This yields a to- QA OpenBookQA,NQ-Open,BoolQ,ARC-Easy,ARC-Challenge PBC SciQ,PIQA",109,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusMonL-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusMonL-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,6.379,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
iclr-2026-4826a74c05ee,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,results,main,Figure 2,5,每个 benchmark 与其余 benchmark 的 mean Kendall’s τ；direct/TBT grouped bars。,double_column,90.00|53.48|523.25|360.36,other,1,1,1,"Figure 2: Mean ranking agreement between each benchmark and all others. We calculate Kendall’s τ between each benchmark and every other benchmark, and then average the results. Compared to direct evaluation, train-before-test consistently improves ranking agreement. A detailed comparison of Kendall’s τ values for every benchmark pair is provided in Appendix B.1. On average, the overall average Kendall’s τ is 0.52 for direct evaluation and 0.76 for train-before-test.",74,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,1,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|LiberationSans,1.906,7.55,10.257,color,2,#DE8F05|#0173B2,0.5391,,,
