iclr-2026-49937f5dcda4,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 4,22,列出各规模各模型的结构参数、最优 learning rate/weight decay、step time、memory。,double_column,90.00|137.52|522.00|388.96,table,1,1,1,"Table 4: Architecture specifications and optimal hyperparameters for our experiments. We report structural parameters (number of layers, number of heads and model width) and training hyperpa- rameters (learning rate and weight decay) that achieved lowest perplexity for each model type and scale. Time measurements show average single-step training cost on NVIDIA H100 GPUs, while Memory measurements show the per-sample peak memory usage during one optimization step.",66,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI9|CMSY9,2.21,8.842,8.842,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
