iclr-2026-4d1471a91635,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 3,3,显示 proposal、API、WM、revision 和真实执行的闭环。,double_column,89.64|207.69|522.00|514.57,other,1,2,1,"Figure 3: Closed-loop online planning in World-In-World: At time step t, the agent receives the world state, represented by observation o , and invokes a proposal policy π (❶) to produce a t proposal total of M candidate action plans. The unified action API (❷) transforms each plan into the control inputs required by the world model. The world model (❸) then predicts the corresponding future states as observations Oˆ . The revision policy π (❹) evaluates all rollouts and commits to the t revision best, yielding decision D⋆. This decision is applied in the environment, closing the interaction loop. t",99,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|URWPalladioL-Roma|CMMI10|Dingbats|CMMI7,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Calibri-Bold|Calibri|Calibri-BoldItalic|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,1.559,9.963,11.955,color,8,#E6EFF7|#88409A|#24535B|#71CCE0|#A473B6|#CBA8BE|#D3DDE6|#648A94,0.0827,,,
