iclr-2026-5d471305c6f6,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 6,18,Adapted Hi-Transformer equation/system/equation architecture.,double_column,90.00|136.81|522.00|443.69,network|architecture,1,2,1,"Figure 6: Architectural adaptation of the Hi-Transformer Wu et al. (2021) for multivariate polyno- mial equation systems. We modified the original layer ordering—originally a repeated sequence of (Sentence, Document, Sentence)—to a grouped configuration of N Equation layers, followed by 2N System layers, and finally N Equation layers. This modification ensures that an equal network depth is allocated to both system-wide and equation-level information processing.",66,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10|CMR10,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,CMSSBX10|CMSS8|CMTT8|CMMI5|CMR5|CMSY10,3.587,5.978,12.298,color,6,#E1F5E1|#FFFAD7|#E1EBFA|#E7F7E7|#D7DFC9|#D8EBD8,0.5485,,,
