iclr-2026-629630d76e2f,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 1,2,并排显示 CMA-MAE 的 cell collision、DMS 的连续 discount 与 2D/10D LP unique-cell 曲线。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|216.57,line,3,3,1,"Figure 1: (a): One failure mode of CMA-MAE. On a flat objective f, solutions θ and θ fall in the 1 2 same archive cell based on their measures, resulting in identical discount values from the discount function f . (b): In our proposed DMS, the discount model provides a smooth discount function A that assigns distinct discount values to θ and θ , showing that θ has greater archive improvement 1 2 2 than θ (∆ > ∆ ) and thus providing a stronger signal to guide search. (c): Number of unique 1 2 1",90,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR7|CMMIB10|CMMI10|CMR10,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,TimesNewRomanPSMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,2.06,8.966,9.963,color,8,#0173B2|#F5E3C2|#C7DFED|#DE8F05|#EBBD6C|#DF9411|#0A78B4|#3587AF,0.2218,,,
