iclr-2026-629630d76e2f,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 11,34,显示 `n_empty=0` 时未探索区域的 arbitrary discount values。,double_column,90.00|198.37|522.00|505.25,heatmap,1,3,1,"Figure 11: Similar to Fig. 8, this figure shows how the archive and discount model in DMS progress across iterations. However, this time, DMS does not train the discount model with any empty points, i.e., n = 0. As a result, the discount model takes on arbitrary values in areas of the measure empty space that have not been explored yet, as evinced by the high values across the discount model heatmap on Iteration 250 and 10000. Because the discount values are high everywhere, the emitters in DMS mistakenly believe they have explored all areas of the measure space, even though the archive is essentially empty.",106,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI7|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,TimesNewRomanPSMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,5.5,5.5,9.963,color,8,#FCFDBF|#623E47|#FDDB9D|#FDE5A6|#FBEBAF|#AFA37F|#FCF0B3|#FCF8BC,0.4453,,,
