iclr-2026-62e38d16d6a3,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,3,跨双栏系统总览与 turn-t state transition，标出四模块、memory、toolset、trained/frozen,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|194.55,pipeline|architecture,2,2,1,"Figure2: (a)Overviewof AGENTFLOW, a trainableagenticsystemfor in-the-flowplanningandtool use. Four modules (planner, executor, verifier, generator) coordinate via a shared evolving memory M and toolset K, given a query q. The planner policy is optimized on-policy inside the system’s multi-turn loop to enable adaptive, long-horizon reasoning. (b) A single state transition, showing the action at, execution result et, and verifier signal vt that update the memory from Mt to Mt+1.",70,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMMI7,9.963,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,ComicSansMS|TimesNewRomanPSMT|ComicSansMS-Bold|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CambriaMath|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT,4.161,4.173,9.963,color,6,#FFF2E6|#DAE8FC|#FFF4CE|#9C8973|#F3D5A6|#C6CDD3,0.7389,,,
iclr-2026-62e38d16d6a3,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,related_work,main,Figure 3,4,跨双栏对照 monolithic tool-integrated reasoning 与 training-free agentic systems,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|205.59,other,2,2,1,"Figure 3: Comparison of two paradigms of LLMs with tool use. (a) Monolithic tool-integrated reasoning models train a single policy to interleave reasoning (e.g., <think>) and tool calls (e.g., <tool call>)withinasingle, full-contexttrajectory. (b)Agenticsystemsdecomposetasksacross multiple specialized modules (e.g., planner, coder) that collaborate. These systems are typically training-free, orchestrated by handcrafted logic or prompting.",57,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusMonL-Regu,9.963,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,TimesNewRomanPSMT|ComicSansMS|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT,5.737,7.516,9.963,color,8,#E6DBEC|#DAE8FC|#D6E8D5|#FFF3CD|#9A8C8B|#CFCFD4|#DAE8FD|#D2E1ED,0.4667,,,
