iclr-2026-6a94cca2daa0,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 1,6,展示 Attention、gated MLP、chunk split、apply/update、Conv1D/projection 的整体因果流程。,double_column,89.75|20.00|523.66|259.34,pipeline|architecture|qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure 1: The overall framework of our In-Place Test-Time Training. The module operates sequen- tially on input chunks. For each chunk, the current fast weights are first applied to the intermediate activations Z to produce the output. Then, these weights are updated using the activations Z and a value V derived from the token embeddings. This ”apply-then-update” cycle allows the model to dynamically adapt to incoming context in a strictly causal manner.",72,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMBX10,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,Arial-BoldMT|ArialMT|CambriaMath|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,2.25,5.909,9.963,color,8,#778495|#BD374A|#6A868F|#732832|#D9D7B6|#D56C4B|#ACA9AC|#6E5B5D,0.5085,,,
