iclr-2026-7d504a5c8916,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,abstract,main,Figure 1,1,用六组 prompt/输出并置 Text-to-3DGS 与 Text-to-Pointmap，说明视频 latent 与 3D decoder 的组合。,double_column,90.00|115.60|522.00|422.48,network|architecture|image_montage,2,3,1,"Figure 1: Text-to-3D generation with VIST3A. Video models excel at generating latent visual con- tent from text prompts, whereas 3D foundation models shine when it comes to decoding such a latent representation into consistent scene geometry. By stitching a video generator and a 3D recon- struction network together and aligning their latents, we obtain an end-to-end model that produces high-quality Gaussian splats (a) or point maps (b) from text prompts.",70,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR7,5.933,5.933,9.963,color,8,#AC7D4C|#7A4727|#1D3657|#D5AF7D|#4F7B9D|#B0C0AA|#8D9DA6|#E7E5BD,0.642,,,
iclr-2026-7d504a5c8916,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 2,2,对比既有 LDM 的 custom 3D decoder 与 VIST3A 的 feedforward 3D model stitching/aligned latent。,double_column,90.00|66.01|525.07|372.89,architecture|qualitative_grid,2,3,1,"Fig. 2. The LDM-like design unifies 2D generation and 2D Generative Model multi-view reconstruction within the latent space and en- ables efficient 3D scene generation with a compact, well- Aligned Latent 3D Representation amortized decoder. Figure 2: Comparison with existing, LDM-based 3D generators. Instead Still, two key limitations remain. First, we argue that the of training a custom decoder from Achilles heel of existing 2D-to-3D diffusion models is the multi-view 2D latents to 3D outputs,",75,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|TimesNewRomanPSMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|TimesNewRomanPSMT,6.034,9.963,11.955,color,8,#81B6A4|#338963|#046D40|#BED9D0|#4184EE|#CCBC7C|#2A9F68|#87643D,0.3246,,,
iclr-2026-7d504a5c8916,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 3,4,上半部为 layer search/stitch-and-finetune，下半部为 full-trajectory direct reward alignment。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|287.57,line|architecture,1,1,1,"Figure 3: VIST3A constructs a 3D VAE through model stitching (top), then aligns it with a gen- erative model via direct reward finetuning (bottom). Stitching repurposes a part of a pretrained 3D vision model as decoder to obtain a 3D VAE. Direct reward finetuning simulates full-trajectory denoising, forcing the generative model to produce 3D-consistent, decodable latents.",56,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,1,1,0,0,3,TimesNewRomanPSMT|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|STIXTwoMath-Regular|TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT|Verdana,4.195,6.356,9.963,color,8,#BEDDDE|#FCC2B5|#FEEBD4|#EFA11A|#AE4C2E|#CF7E35|#7FAEA5|#E1B658,0.6766,,,
