iclr-2026-82716d8e922b,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 7,28,无 ground truth 的 moving-average detector 各 offline quantile 结果。,double_column,89.60|263.07|522.00|514.51,table,1,1,1,"Table 7 summarizes the results on the PE dataset. Despite the absence of oracle information, the belief-based truncation retains strong performance, closely matching or surpassing the oracle-based T3 reported in the main paper.",33,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMBX10|CMBX7,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusMonL-Regu|CMMI10|CMMI7|CMR10,6.974,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0057,,,
iclr-2026-82716d8e922b,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 8,28,online quantile adaptive T3 的 α sensitivity。,double_column,89.69|634.03|522.00|772.00,table,1,1,1,"Table 8 reports the performance across quantiles α. The results exhibit non-monotonic dependence on α. Notably, at α = 0.6, the adaptive variant achieves a substantial improvement, outperforming both the PPO baseline and the oracle-based T3 result reported in the main text. These results highlight the potential for extending the T3 principle to adaptive thresholding, and we leave a more in-depth exploration to future work.",65,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10|CMR10|CMBX10|CMBX7,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusMonL-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10|CMR10|CMR7,6.974,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
