iclr-2026-8374ca36d622,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 12,28,"Expanded Pythia-160m t-SNE comparison of Temporal high/low, Matryoshka, BatchTopK, and baseline latent representations across three labels.",double_column,90.00|291.64|522.02|598.52,other,1,1,1,"Figure 12: TSNE visualizations of Pythia-160m SAE decompositions of MMLU questions, labeled by question category (left), question number (middle column), and token part of speech (right). We see that the high-level features from Temporal SAEs (second row) recover semantic and contextual information. The low-level features of Temporal SAEs (third row), as well as Matryoshka and BatchTopK SAEs (fourth and fifth row), recover syntactic information. Baseline model latent (last row) balance a mix of information.",74,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,1,1,0,0,0,2,CourierNewPSMT|Inter-Regular,0.983,1.145,5.956,color,6,#E5ECF6|#C7BECE|#E6E1EC|#BC89B2|#B8DDD9|#D4EEE8,0.7118,,,
iclr-2026-842e6221ed35,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,abstract,main,Figure 1,1,六 app、可配置版本和跨版本 success 例子，建立新 reliability 轴,double_column,90.00|310.84|522.00|617.72,other,1,2,1,"Figure 1: OPENAPPS can generate thousands of configurable versions of apps. OPENAPPS contains six apps covering common digital tasks with configurable appearance and app data for measuring a new dimension of reliability: across app variations agents are likely to encounter. OPENAPPS can be deployed anywhere Python can run with a single CPU (without specialized hard- ware, emulators or setup). In the right panel, we see average success rates for the same tasks and agents can fluctuate across app versions, suggesting app variation is a key axis of reliability.",88,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal,9.963,1,1,1,0,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Graphik-Regular|Produkt-Light|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|Graphik-Light,2.301,9.963,10.069,color,8,#94B9DA|#CBEBFE|#E4D6A9|#B8DBE8|#6CC2AE|#8F5582|#8D93A1|#C5C0BE,0.2181,,,
iclr-2026-842e6221ed35,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,4,六个 app 的 appearance variation 截图,double_column,90.00|183.43|522.00|490.31,qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure 2: Screenshots with example appearance variations of all six apps in OPENAPPS: OpenToDo, OpenCalendar, OpenMessenger, OpenMaps, OpenCodeEditor, and OpenShop. Each app is a fully functional Python application with editable state and appearance. OpenApps can be configured via simple YAML files.",41,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10|CMMI7|CMR7,6.974,9.963,9.963,color,8,#CFE9FD|#C6E4EF|#A4D5F7|#B7DBE7|#BDCBCC|#DDEDF3|#808496|#CDDBD7,0.2925,,,
iclr-2026-842e6221ed35,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 3,5,OpenApps–Agent loop，连接 observation、action、state 和 reward,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|294.89,tree,1,1,1,"Figure 3: We organize agents interactions with OPENAPPS using the standard terminologylof re- inforcement learning. The environment state s is defined by design and content variables, and t initialized from a YAML specification. At each step t, the agent receives observations o (screen- t shot and accessibility tree) and issues an action a ∼ π(a |{a ,o }t) through BrowserGym API t t i−1 i 0 calls. Task success is evaluated using the underlying app state s . t",79,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10|CMMI7|CMSY10|CMR10,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,font000000002e832ff3|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,4.318,7.403,9.963,color,8,#BBCDFF|#F1D8D3|#FF6956|#76BADE|#F3B798|#D0EAFF|#7B86CA|#E0DBB6,0.6832,,,
iclr-2026-842e6221ed35,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,results,main,Figure 4,7,各 agent 在 app versions 上的 min/median/max average task success,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|286.25,bar,1,1,1,Figure 4: Agents are sensitive to app variations. We show that the average success rate over all tasks differs across app variations. Each bar represents the average success rate over all tasks within a single app version (with three random seeds per task). Note we filter tasks where an agent has a success rate of 0 across all app variations. We see success rates can differ considerably across app versions.,70,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,1,1,0,0,3,Verdana|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,3.844,6.919,9.963,color,8,#FA8775|#FFB14E|#FFD700|#FFE8B2|#98999A|#8B7574|#FFC070|#F7CCA2,0.8544,,,
iclr-2026-842e6221ed35,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,results,main,Figure 5,8,within fixed app 与 across app versions 的 STD 对照,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|320.47,bar,1,1,1,Figure 5: Reliability within fixed app versions underestimates fluctuations in performance. In the middle of each bar we show the standard deviation of task success. We compare two settings: within a fixed app version compared to overall deviation that also accounts for difference in agent success rates across app variations.,50,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,1,1,1,0,4,ArialMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Arial-BoldMT,6.644,6.644,9.963,color,6,#FFB14E|#F1CC9A|#FAE4C6|#F9C179|#98713E|#FBCC91,0.538,,,
iclr-2026-842e6221ed35,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,results,main,Figure 6,8,UI-TARS appearance 与 Kimi-VL content case，附 seed STD,double_column,90.00|289.62|522.00|596.50,tree|qualitative_grid,1,3,1,"Figure 6: Agent reliability can be low in terms of performance across app variations. Model performance (as measured by the task success rate across random seeds, averaged over all tasks) can differ greatly across appearance and content variations (shown in Figure 7). For example, we notice a sizable drop in the performance of UI-TARS-1.5-7B (a vision-only model) compared to the default when the app has a dark theme, and likewise a drop in the performance of Kimi-VL-A3B-Instruct when the app is in German or contains adversarial page descriptions. The black bars capture the standard deviation of rewards across seeds, averaged over tasks. The task prompt is explicit and fixed. Kimi uses visual and AX tree inputs while UI-TARS is UI-visual only.",122,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,1,1,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|ArialMT|Arial-BoldMT,6.644,9.963,9.963,color,8,#1F77B4|#66C2A5|#CEE7E7|#143644|#A0D1D1|#508FA2|#72B9BA|#64BFA2,0.376,,,
