iclr-2026-9b8d9a086a72,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 1,2,跨栏展示 input encoder、feature-space warping 与 recurrent update ×T 的 meta-architecture；每步对 frame-2 feature 做 lightweight backward warp。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|207.60,architecture|image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure 1: The meta-architecture of WAFT consists of an input encoder and a recurrent update module. We first extractimagefeaturesfromtheinputencoder, andthenusethesefeaturestoiterativelyupdatetheflowestimate for T steps. At each step, we perform feature indexing through a lightweight backward warping on the feature of frame 2, removing the dependency on expensive cost volume used by previous work.",52,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI9,8.966,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,HelveticaNeue|HelveticaNeue-Medium|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|STIXGeneral-Italic|STIXGeneral-Regular,5.651,9.077,10.28,color,8,#FF9300|#B51700|#372E59|#3D4F6B|#F6C896|#726F83|#FF9301|#7E93A3,0.3977,,,
