iclr-2026-9d74a65ca00d,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,跨栏展示 Bayes/Approximation loss 分解、dataset-size validation gap 与 downstream critical point。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|193.94,line,1,2,1,"Figure 1: Left: Total loss is decomposed into Bayes Risk (decreasing with context length) and Ap- proximation Loss (increasing with context length), so a critical point can emerge in some scenarios. Middle: Validation Loss Gap (Val Loss - min (Val Loss) vs. Context Length), measured on sub- D sets of OpenWebText, where we subtract the minimum loss within each dataset-size curve (please refer to Figure 15 for the original figure). For each training dataset size, there exists an optimal context length that minimizes pretraining validation loss, and this optimum increases with dataset size. Right: Error rate of Qwen series models on the CWE task from RulerBench when a certain amount of context is masked. Critical points are visible. More results on other RulerBench subsets",123,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI7,9.963,0,1,1,1,1,0,4,"Aptos,Bold|CambriaMath|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",2.47,4.824,9.963,color,8,#A9C6C2|#59A398|#E5F2E0|#6FC889|#6A7F8C|#514078|#BDA6A5|#F7F086,0.2419,,,
iclr-2026-9d74a65ca00d,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 2,5,三种 LM 的 CE–Gaussian-KDE Intrinsic Entropy 线性关系。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|187.40,other,1,1,1,"Figure 2: Cross Entropy loss vs. Gaussian-KDE measured Intrinsic Entropy (in nats) for three Language Models on a subset of OpenWebText: Llama-3.1-8B (left, k = −0.0038, R = −0.9888), Qwen3-8B-Base (middle, k = −0.0026, R = −0.9960), and RecurrentGemma-9B (right, k = −0.0174, R = −0.9967, with 3 outlier points at high CE loss excluded from regression). The linear relationship between CE loss and Intrinsic Entropy holds across different model architectures.",72,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR10|CMMI10|CMSY10,9.963,0,1,1,0,0,0,2,Aptos|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,6.852,6.852,9.963,color,8,#BFD7E9|#A5CED6|#C4DAEB|#CAE3E6|#BCE1D7|#E2EFF2|#D8EEE8|#62A0C8,0.1045,,,
iclr-2026-9d74a65ca00d,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,experimental_design,main,Figure 3,6,Position-Weighted Ruler-QA1 的文档、距离和查询概率构造。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|202.44,other,1,2,1,"Figure 3: Our modified Position-Weighted Ruler-QA1 (Hsieh et al., 2024) dataset. Multiple para- graphs are concatenated together with context length close to MaxCtl, and a question queries the ‘golden paragraph’ (i.e. the doc paragraph with answer to that query). In the original Ruler-QA1 dataset each doc has equal probability of being queried (i.e. γ = 0); while in our experiments shown in Figure 4, we measure LLM performance on a set of tasks with different hyper-parameter γ, each with different probability of querying far-away contexts.",86,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10|CMR10,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,"CambriaMath|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Aptos,Bold|Aptos",6.521,8.892,9.963,color,8,#ABC4D2|#6F9CB3|#EFDA96|#FFF3D1|#FFCA2A|#FFC002|#5D86AF|#2C4D82,0.5408,,,
