iclr-2026-a15993a7b6c3,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,用端到端流程展示 voice/text scripts、hybrid context、LLM、Diffusion Head、Acoustic Decoder 与多说话人输出。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|301.96,pipeline|architecture,2,2,1,"Figure 1: Scalable and expressive podcast synthesis with VIBEVOICE. Voice prompts and text scripts provide initial input. VIBEVOICE processes hybrid context features, and its hidden states condition a token level Diffusion Head (D), which predicts acoustic VAE for speech segments, subsequently recovered by acoustic decoder (A).",46,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,Aptos|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,6.742,8.539,12.15,color,6,#D2E1F4|#224353|#9AABB2|#6D949F|#6F7377|#CEAF9E,0.7236,,,
iclr-2026-a15993a7b6c3,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,3,并列对照 acoustic σ-VAE reconstruction 与 semantic ASR proxy tokenizer。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|147.55,architecture,2,2,1,"2014), as demonstrated in Figure 2. A latent vector z is then sampled using the reparameterization trick. Following the σ-VAE approach to ensure robust variance for autoregressive modeling, we can formulate this as: µ = Encoder (x) ϕ z = µ + σ ⊙ ϵ,where ϵ ∼ N(0,1), σ ∼ N(0,C ) σ xˆ = Decoder (z) ψ",55,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR10|CMMI10|CMMIB10|CMSY10,9.963,0,1,0,1,1,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10|CMMIB10,9.963,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
