iclr-2026-a15993a7b6c3,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 4,15,展示 Coupled Tokenizer 的共享 latent μ 同时进入 acoustic 与 semantic decoder。,double_column,90.00|75.78|522.00|382.66,architecture|conceptual_diagram,1,1,1,"Figure 4: An illustration of the Coupled Tokenizer architecture. A single encoder produces a shared latent representation µ, which is utilized for both speech reconstruction (Acoustic Decoder) and ASR (Semantic Decoder). This design contrasts with our final Hybrid architecture (Figure 2), which employs separate encoders to decouple semantic and acoustic representations.",51,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,"NimbusMonL-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Aptos,Italic|Aptos|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CambriaMath",5.792,8.966,10.531,color,8,#DCEAFF|#EFDABF|#495660|#AAAAB0|#CBEFD1|#798C98|#C8D5E1|#E6EEF9,0.1488,,,
