iclr-2026-a360ac840b2a,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 1,4,示意 uniform training 将 loss 分散到 planner 不走的路径，PAPL 以权重聚焦 preferred trajectories。,double_column,90.00|20.00|523.74|188.42,conceptual_diagram,1,1,1,"Figure 1: Planner-Aware Path Learning (PAPL) resolves training–inference mismatch in DLMs. Standard uniform training for DLMs (left) applies a uniform loss across all masked positions, distributing capacity over regions that inference-time planners never traverse. PAPL (right) introduces planner-awareweightsintotheloss, aligningtrainingwiththeplanner’spreferredtrajectories(outlined arrows) and eliminating training-inference mismatch.",47,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,1,0,0,0,2,HelveticaNeue-Medium|HelveticaNeue|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.72,9.963,12.6,color,8,#E1C9DF|#E2CAE0|#E1C9E0|#761473|#B294B1|#944492|#E1CAE0|#C8B1C6,0.2985,,,
