iclr-2026-a360ac840b2a,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 5,41,固定 denoiser 比较 Greedy、Probability Margin、P2-Self 的 text sampling planners。,double_column,89.69|203.79|523.25|455.23,table,1,2,1,"Table 5 compares inference-time planners while holding the denoiser fixed. Across all step budgets, P2-Self sampling consistently yields the best quality–diversity tradeoff: it achieves the highest MAUVE and the lowest generative perplexity, with only a mild reduction in entropy relative to Greedy and Probability Margin. The gap is most pronounced in the fast-sampling regime. At T = 64, Greedy decoding as in MaskGIT (Chang et al., 2022) substantially underperforms, suggesting that purely myopic confidence selection can lock the trajectory into suboptimal local choices when the model is imperfect. Probability Margin (Kim et al., 2025) improves over Greedy at intermediate and large T, but remains below P2-Self and does not scale monotonically with more steps, indicating that margin-based heuristics are less robust to sampling budget. Overall, these results reinforce that",129,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,0,1,0,1,1,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR10|CMMI10,7.97,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0205,,,
iclr-2026-a360ac840b2a,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 5,42,暴露 pure PAPL loss 的 training fluctuation 与 validation non-convergence。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|230.49,line,1,1,1,"Figure 5: Training with pure PAPL loss (τ = 1) leads to unstable behavior, with large fluctuations in training (left) and poor convergence on validation (right).",25,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,0,0,1,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,2.493,8.966,9.963,color,8,#4D8CD3|#6D9FD7|#B5CFE9|#DAE7F4|#5790D1|#8DB4DF|#4E8BD1|#4C8BD2,0.5706,,,
iclr-2026-a360ac840b2a,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 6,42,固定 code denoiser 比较 vanilla、greedy、entropy confidence、TopK-margin、P2-self。,double_column,89.64|416.87|523.65|668.31,table,1,2,1,"Table 6 compares P2-self against several commonly used alternatives: (i) vanilla ancestral sampling with uniform unmasking, (ii) greedy ancestral sampling that always selects the highest-confidence positions, (iii) entropy-based confidence ordering, and (iv) the TopK-margin heuristic. Across all six code benchmarks, P2-self is consistently the strongest method. The improvements are most pronounced in Pass@1, where P2-self exceeds the best baseline by large margins (e.g., 20.8 vs. 12.6 on HumanEval and 16.7 vs. 9.2 on MBPP), and it also yields steady gains in Pass@10 and in the infilling and SantaCoder evaluations. Among baselines, confidence-aware orderings (greedy ancestral and entropy-based confidence) substantially outperform vanilla ancestral sampling, indicating that exploiting denoiser uncertainty during decoding is critical for code generation. However, these heuris-",125,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,1,0,1,1,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,6.193,9.963,11.955,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
iclr-2026-a360ac840b2a,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 6,43,解释 PAPL weights 从 near-zero、上升到稳定下降的 training-curve 过程。,double_column,89.64|20.00|522.00|198.44,line,1,2,1,"Figure 6: Vanilla MDM vs PAPL Training Curves. Early in training, the PAPL loss remains small because the denoiser has not yet formed meaningful beliefs about the correct token positions, causing the planner-dependent weights w to be close to zero. As the model begins to identify correct positions i with higher certainty, these weights increase, leading to a temporary rise in the PAPL loss. Once the denoiser becomes sufficiently confident, the loss decreases and eventually mirrors the behavior of the standard MDM loss. These dynamics provide additional evidence that PAPL naturally adapts its emphasis as the model’s confidence improves, stabilizing precisely when confidence becomes a reliable signal.",108,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10|CMMI7,9.963,1,1,0,1,1,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,9.963,9.963,color,8,#D42728|#2078B3|#CAC6D1|#D5393A|#1E78B2|#D32627|#D32727|#808BA9,0.5802,,,
