iclr-2026-af6a7ff26bd9,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,总流程图，串联 hybrid signals、scenario-specific persona、rubrics、individual/prototype scaling 与最终分数。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|277.01,line|pipeline,1,1,1,"Figure 1: Workflow of P-GenRM. P-GenRM infers a scenario-specific user persona and preference analysis from hybrid preference signals, generates dynamic scoring rubrics, and assesses candi- date responses accordingly. At test-time, P-GenRM can aggregate multiple individual-level scoring schemes and incorporate similar users’ preferences to improve scoring accuracy and generalization.",48,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|TimesNewRomanPSMT|SegoePrint-Bold|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Calibri|CambriaMath,1.713,4.833,9.963,color,8,#E8F1F9|#C8DFD9|#7E7785|#E9EEFE|#DABAA9|#7E2A34|#7EAAC3|#FCE9DB,0.332,,,
