iclr-2026-b93abeea95e9,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,abstract,main,Figure 1,1,Budget-threshold pass@1 curves; all curves plateau and no model dominates across cost.,double_column,90.00|361.08|522.00|667.96,line,1,2,1,"Figure 1: Gaia2 budget scaling curve: for each max budget, we plot (cid:80)1{scenario result = True ∧ scenario cost < max budget}. Equipped with a simple ReAct-like scaffold (see Section 3), no model evaluated here dominates across the intelligence spectrum—each trades off capability, efficiency, and budget. At equal cost, some models fare better, yet all curves plateau, suggesting that standard scaffolds and/or models miss ingredients for sustained progress. Cost estimates from Artificial Analysis model pricing data (accessed September 10, 2025).",82,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMEX10|CMSY10|unknown|CMR10,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Optimistic-Regular|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|DejaVuSans,1.386,9.963,9.963,color,8,#DFE2F3|#E9E8FD|#92A0BB|#DDCDDB|#7D56CE|#98C5C4|#EAF2FF|#C7E1E3,0.242,,,
