iclr-2026-c5caee9922e5,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 1,3,Workflow：worker/order pool 状态更新，IDDQN/TD3 分别产生 Q/probability matrix，再由 ILP 做 assignment 并回到下一状态。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|291.07,matrix|pipeline,1,2,1,"Figure 1: Workflow: At each time step, the worker and order pools update their states based on the assignments made in the previous time step. Specifically, the order pool adds newly arrived orders and removes overdue ones. For IDDQN, the Q-value of each worker-order pair is calculated, and ILP is applied to maximize the global Q-value. For TD3, the probability of each worker-order pair is computed, followed by the application of ILP to maximize the global assignment probability.",78,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,9.963,9.963,color,8,#FADBDF|#D4F4F2|#809BB7|#979DBA|#6E78AA|#8CB9C4|#C1B4C7|#DCCFD6,0.3423,,,
iclr-2026-c5caee9922e5,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,4,Network architecture：Worker/Order Encoder、Actor-BERT/QK-Attention、selected fused sequence、双 Critic-BERT/MLP 的信息流。,double_column,89.64|130.72|523.25|437.60,network|architecture,1,3,1,"Figure 2: Network Architecture: The network consists of three main components: the feature extractor, the actor sub-network, and the critic sub-network. First, a worker encoder and an order encoder are used to extract features from individual worker and order information, respectively. Then an Actor BERT model captures the relationships between them and a QK-Attention module calculates the selection probabilities for each worker-order pair. Finally, the fused features of the selected worker-order pairs are input into two separate Critic BERT models for further information extraction, and two Critic MLPs compute the Q-values, as TD3 requires two critics. (In this figure, the fused sequence (input to Critic-BERT) represents workers 1, 3, 6, and n selecting orders 2, 3, 4, and m, respectively.)",120,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10|CMMI7|CMR10|CMR7,6.974,9.963,11.955,color,8,#FEE695|#9CE5E0|#BBC8E3|#DDE8E4|#A89491|#9E4045|#99B5BA|#DDB6A7,0.32,,,
