iclr-2026-d2112f671397,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 1,4,展示 high-resolution/blurred inputs、DINOv2 patch tokens、双 Perceiver query nets 和 UNet cross-attention 的 MetamerGen 架构。,double_column,90.00|51.56|522.00|358.44,architecture|image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure 1: MetamerGen model architecture. High-resolution and blurred, low-resolution images are processed through DINOv2-Base to extract patch tokens. Foveal features are obtained by apply- ing binary masks to high-resolution patch tokens, retaining only fixated regions. Both foveal and peripheral patch tokens are processed through separate Perceiver-based query networks that com- press features into conditioning tokens compatible with Stable Diffusion’s cross-attention mecha- nism. The resulting dual conditioning streams are integrated into the pretrained UNet.",74,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal,9.963,1,1,0,0,0,0,1,unknown,1.817,5.567,11.135,color,8,#32A7AA|#4C4F3F|#DBFAF7|#D8456A|#BCE7D8|#E7E4D3|#A0C965|#ACA180,0.2436,,,
