iclr-2026-e7be893c9452,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,展示单图 naïve rationale 的视觉幻觉、contrastive pair 对照，以及 H/C/C&H 对初始 hard failures 的纠正结果。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|313.48,other,2,3,1,"Figure 1: Contrasting makes the VLM see better. (a) Contrastive VQA pairs compels a more accurate response. (b) Compared with a previous self-improving method STaR (Zelikman et al., 2022) that enhances the quality of reasoning with hints (ground-truth answers), contrasting with hints can rectify more cases. The blocks along the x-axis mark initial VLM failures. The color of each block indicates the outcome of rectifying: green for success and gray for failure. Tested VLM is Qwen2.5VL-7B (Bai et al., 2025).",81,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,1,0,1,1,0,0,2,Calibri|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|ComicSansMS|TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT|Helvetica|AppleColorEmoji,3.851,5.144,10.289,color,8,#DEEBF7|#A0D8C0|#FEF2CE|#705875|#C7E5DD|#8B99AA|#C7CB9B|#66CA9D,0.6046,,,
iclr-2026-e7be893c9452,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 2,3,介绍 VisCoR-55K 的 21 个 VQA datasets、5 类组成与代表性 contrastive examples。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|304.75,qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure 2: VisCoR-55K. We introduce the Visual Contrastive Reasoning dataset (VisCoR-55K), a new collection of 55K high-quality visual reasoning samples. Spanning the domains of general VQA, reasoning, math, graph/chart, and OCR, each sample is created by leveraging a contrastive counterpart to generate a faithful rationale. Rationales are shown in the Sec. A.4.",54,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR10,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,Calibri-Bold|HelveticaNeue-Medium|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,5.775,5.775,9.963,color,8,#81ABAD|#FCD8AA|#FCF8E6|#F8A82A|#E7E1C8|#71515B|#B0807F|#F0A2C4,0.5785,,,
