iclr-2026-e7ef44128dd8,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 2,16,定性显示 VGGT 与 COLMAP 对 weak/heavy visual distortion 的 TPS-oracle 鲁棒性。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|190.67,qualitative_grid,2,3,1,"Figure 2: Qualitative Robustness Analysis of TPS Oracles. We evaluate the robustness of VGGT (Wang et al., 2025b) and COLMAP (Scho¨nberger et al., 2016; Scho¨nberger & Frahm, 2016b) oracles against visual corruptions. (a) VGGT is effectively invariant to minor distortions, while COLMAP quickly diverges. (b) VGGT maintains robustness even under significant random distor- tion, whereas COLMAP fails to register poses entirely.",62,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,0,0,0,1,unknown|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,2.666,8.004,9.963,color,8,#E4BF77|#523314|#A98C4D|#CBA159|#FBD784|#A5582D|#F3C778|#CA934A,0.7746,,,
iclr-2026-e7ef44128dd8,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 8,16,量化 VGGT/COLMAP 的 R/T/AUC accuracy 和 Success Rate，检查 oracle corruption 稳定性。,double_column,126.63|485.97|485.37|737.41,table,1,2,1,"Table 8: Quantitative Robustness Analysis of TPS Oracles. We evaluate the robustness of the VGGT (Wang et al., 2025b) and COLMAP (Scho¨nberger et al., 2016; Scho¨nberger & Frahm, 2016b) oracles against visual corruptions by mea- suring the TPS between reference and corrupted videos. A weak distortion, visu- alized in Fig. 2(a), is applied to the video. We find that the VGGT oracle is sig- nificantly more robust across all datasets and metrics. In contrast, the COLMAP oracle suffers from an excessive rejection ratio, diminishing the utility of the eval- uation samples.",93,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusMonL-Regu,8.966,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0215,,,
iclr-2026-e7ef44128dd8,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 3,17,对比 LVSM 在 in-distribution interpolation 与 out-of-distribution extrapolation target 上的重建 artifact。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|216.72,image_montage,2,3,1,"Figure3: SupervisedMethodsAlsoStruggle. Substantialreconstructionartifactsarealsoobserved in supervised models when rendering difficult target views. The first and last frames are used as context views. (a) The supervised baseline, LVSM (Jin et al., 2024), excels at reconstructing easier target views. (b) However, LVSM struggles to cleanly render difficult target views, showing blurry or warped artifacts in the reconstruction.",54,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,0,0,1,0,0,1,unknown|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,7.037,7.037,9.963,color,8,#7F7364|#594539|#B37655|#9A8F7E|#C9B69A|#C68E68|#9CB49B|#925039,0.7154,,,
iclr-2026-e7ef44128dd8,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 9,17,报告 transferred videos 上 XFactor 与 RayZer 经 COLMAP 的 Success Rate，显示 rejection fragility。,double_column,126.63|380.16|485.37|631.60,table,1,1,1,"Table 9: Fragility of COLMAP on Transferred Videos We find that COLMAP is highly fragile when applied to transferred videos. In particular, samples from the baseline method, RayZer (Jiang et al., 2025), exhibit a significantly higher rejection ratio, preventing meaningful measurement of transferability with TPS.",45,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
