iclr-2026-e87e18e18569,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 6,19,A duplicate rendering of the retrieval file-hit-rate table placed beside annotator demographics.,double_column,89.64|438.68|523.74|690.12,table,1,2,1,"To ensure the accuracy and reliability of our Table 6: File hit rates of different retrieval methods. benchmark annotations, we assemble a quali- Each value gives the fraction of queries whose fied annotation team composed of 12 individuals correct file appears within the Top-2, Top-10, or with diverse backgrounds in computer science Top-20 retrieved results. and software engineering. Specifically, the team Method Top-2 Top-10 Top-20 consists of eight Ph.D. students, two Master’s students, one undergraduate student, and one as- BM25 0.182 0.207 0.195 sistant professor. All annotators hold academic Block Chunks 0.207 0.341 0.329 Function Chunks 0.277 0.371 0.368",110,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,0,1,1,0,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,7.97,9.963,11.955,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
iclr-2026-e943a2f002d1,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,1,音乐创作者的理解—生成—自我反思循环，说明统一音频智能动机。,double_column,90.00|290.75|522.00|597.63,other,1,1,1,"emplified by a music composer who iteratively cre- Figure 1: Humans need understanding, gen- ates a piece (generation), critically listens to it (un- eration, and reasoning to handle complex derstanding), and refines it (self-reflection) (Hallam tasks, like composing music. et al., 2016). This human paradigm of tightly inte- grating understanding, generation, and reasoning motivates our work and suggests that unifying these three pillars is a crucial step toward advanced and general audio intelligence.",73,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,6.974,9.963,11.955,color,8,#A7A094|#F1D19A|#D0E3EA|#B58C64|#D4B48F|#75787B|#F2D3AA|#EBEBE5,0.2377,,,
