iclr-2026-f448909bdd66,ICLR,oral,replication_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table A1,19,"Full/Tiny VAE parameters, compression, decoding time, and reconstruction quality.",double_column,90.00|156.80|522.00|408.24,table,1,1,1,Table A1: Comparison of Causal VAE Models. We evaluate reconstruction quality on the Sora demo samples (resized to 81f×832×480) by encoding videos with the Full VAE encoder and de- coding with different VAE variants. Our Tiny VAE achieves an order-of-magnitude faster decoding than Full VAEs while outperforming existing community implementations in reconstruction quality.,55,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMSY10,9.963,1,0,0,1,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR10|CMSY10|CMSY7|CMR7,6.974,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
iclr-2026-f448909bdd66,ICLR,oral,replication_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table A2,19,Full versus Tiny VAE in the distilled streaming setup.,double_column,90.00|585.10|522.00|772.00,table,1,1,1,"Table A2: Evaluating Tiny VAE in Streaming Generation Setup. Using the same distilled stu- dent model, we ablate the impact of switching VAE from original Full VAE to Tiny VAE in Sora demo subset. It’s important to note that even after changing to Tiny VAE, our distilled models still outperform all other baselines and quality differences compared to Full VAEs are marginal while achieving 1.75× and 2.3× higher throughput.",72,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMSY10,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusMonL-Regu,8.966,8.966,11.955,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
iclr-2026-f448909bdd66,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure A1,20,Pairwise user-study preference rates on 20 Sora samples.,double_column,90.00|282.59|522.00|589.47,architecture|qualitative_grid|image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure A1: User Study Results. We evaluate video quality through pairwise comparisons on 20 Sora samples. In terms of pure video quality, our models outperform all baselines except ATI, which uses a 10× larger backbone (Wan 2.1-14B), producing visually favorable videos.",42,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMSY10,9.963,1,0,0,1,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|TimesNewRomanPSMT|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|CMSY10,5.506,9.963,9.963,color,2,#3B82C4|#9CA3AF,0.543,,,
