iclr-2026-f63ee6bf1935,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,ablation,main,Figure 3 (a–b),4,比较 GRPO reward 与 SFT/GRPO 随训练样本量的准确率和效率。,double_column,90.00|130.01|522.00|436.89,qualitative_grid,1,3,1,"As shown in Fig. 3a, GRPO is not very sensitive to the reward function, we experiment with 1) δ , 1 2) negative AbsRel, i.e., the negative value of absolute relative difference (Ranftl et al., 2020), 3) the negative L loss, and 4) the negative L loss. All metrics have reasonable accuracy. Overall, the 2 1 negative L loss is a simple and effective reward. With this reward, we tuned other GRPO hyper- 1 parameters (see Appendix A.4), and compare GRPO with SFT. As shown in Fig. 3b, given the same number of training samples, SFT and GRPO perform similarly well. However, GRPO requires much",106,7,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMMI10|CMR7|CMSY10,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,1,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10,7.97,9.963,9.963,color,8,#878EB8|#EA9775|#5D4D53|#878EB7|#E99775|#696E8F|#E49373|#EA9774,0.0757,,,
iclr-2026-f63ee6bf1935,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,ablation,main,Figure 4 (a–c),5,比较相机歧义策略、统一焦距扫描与训练图像数。,double_column,90.00|131.08|522.00|437.96,architecture|image_montage,3,3,1,"prompts of 2) and 3). As shown in Fig. 4a, unifying the focal length doubles the accuracy of other approaches. Moreover, adding intrinsics explicitly in text or predicting camera intrinsics do not have higher accuracy than direct mix data training. This result shows that Finding 3. Without architecture change, VLMs struggle to distinguish different cameras, unifying the focal length by intrinsic-conditioned augmentations can effectively resolve camera ambiguity.",67,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI9,5.978,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0167,,,
