iclr-2026-f8c3d1a8ada1,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,abstract,main,Figure 1,1,将 classical Rodrigues formula、learnable operator 与 motion/imitation/hand applications 放在同一概念桥上。,double_column,90.00|61.43|522.00|368.31,network,1,2,1,"Figure 1: We introduce the Neural Rodrigues Operator, a learnable extension of the classical Rodrigues’ Rotation Formula from robot control, where the original coefficients are replaced with trainable weights and joint angles are generalized to abstract features. Built upon this operator, the Rodrigues Network leverages the kinematic structure of articulated systems to advance a wide range of action-learning tasks.",59,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|TimesNewRomanPSMT|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CambriaMath|CMSY7,6.974,9.351,17.215,color,8,#80AAA5|#2D3651|#E6EDD9|#EA8C42|#9FD0B2|#5E5E64|#517F7B|#B27E61,0.2862,,,
iclr-2026-f8c3d1a8ada1,ICLR,oral,replication_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,5,展示 Rodrigues Block 中 Rodrigues Layer、Joint Layer、Self-attention Layer 与 global token 的顺序数据流。,double_column,90.00|20.00|522.00|209.62,other,1,1,1,"Figure 2: Rodrigues Block. It comprises three components: a Rodrigues Layer for passing infor- mation from joints to links, constructed with our Multi-Channel Neural Rodrigues Operator; a Joint Layer for passing information from links to joints; and a Self-Attention Layer for global information exchange with all the links and the global token.",52,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|TimesNewRomanPSMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CambriaMath,1.707,7.894,9.963,color,8,#E4DFF1|#FFF8E1|#6E679C|#CDE3DB|#F5CA68|#B8BECA|#F8E5B0|#FCECCE,0.3042,,,
