iclr-2026-f8f364a44221,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,ablation,main,Table 5,7,"Science cross-product of exact/fuzzy/no deduplication with 1×, 4× and 16× teacher sampling.",double_column,89.69|285.63|522.17|537.07,table,1,1,1,Table 5: Deduplication and repeated teacher sampling provide an axis of scale. Using fewer questions and annotating more times performs similarly or even outperforms annotating more questions fewer times. There does not seem to be a clear trend in types of deduplication that improve performance. Full results including math and code datasets are in Tables 40 to 42.,58,4,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,1,1,0,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusMonL-Regu,7.97,9.963,9.963,color,5,#E6E6FF|#AAAAFF|#E8E8FF|#9797B1|#DADAF2,0.3163,,,
iclr-2026-f8f364a44221,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,ablation,main,Table 6,8,Math answer-filtering comparisons for no/random/shortest/non-English/GPT verification and other strategies.,double_column,89.69|234.30|522.00|485.74,table,1,1,1,Table 6: Filtering answers did not improve over not filtering at all. Using verification techniques such as majority consensus filtering or response-length-based filtering did not improve upon training on all samples. Full results including code and science datasets are in Tables 43 to 45.,44,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR7|CMMI7|CMR10|CMSY10,6.974,9.963,9.963,color,4,#E6E6FF|#CACAFF|#9999B2|#E1E1F9,0.4433,,,
iclr-2026-f8f364a44221,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,ablation,main,Table 7,8,"Teacher comparison for QwQ-32B, DeepSeek-R1 and Phi-4-Reasoning-Plus across domain averages.",double_column,89.69|372.44|523.24|623.88,table,1,1,1,"Table 7: Using a weaker teacher outperformed using a stronger teacher. Across all domains, QwQ-32B was the strongest teacher model, despite being a weaker model than DeepSeek-R1. Further results can be seen in Table 48.",35,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusMonL-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR10|CMSY10,7.97,9.963,9.963,color,4,#E6E6FF|#CACAFF|#9999B2|#E1E1F9,0.3372,,,
