iclr-2026-f8f364a44221,ICLR,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 28,39,OpenThinker3-7B and teacher model benchmark comparison including held-out tasks.,double_column,89.69|525.90|523.75|772.00,table,1,1,1,"Table 28: Comparison of OpenThinker3-7B to teacher models. We see that DeepSeek-R1 is empirically the best model overall and our actual teacher model, QwQ-32B, is empirically worse. Phi-4-Reasoning-Plus performs empirically poorly on code evaluations since it outputs code without code tags which Evalchemy marks as incorrect.",46,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,9.963,1,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.564,9.963,11.955,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
