icml-2026-2b91f2863fcf,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 10,16,Tests fixed and linear schedule alternatives against AutoMOG.,page_width,36.94|448.87|560.69|700.31,table,1,1,1,"Table 10. Ablation on Guidance Strength and Scheduling. Comparison performed on SD-XL. Standard CFG shows a clear trade-off: weak guidance (w = 1) yields poor alignment, while strong guidance (w = 15) destroys fidelity. Linear Decay improves upon static scales but still falls short of AutoMOG, which achieves the best Pareto frontier across all metrics.",53,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMR9|CMMI9,8.966,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMR10|CMMI10|CMSY10,6.974,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0017,,,
