icml-2026-35879ec17414,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 8,20,Summarize a higher-beta(T) creative variant across the 27 triplets.,page_width,36.94|702.79|559.44|772.00,table,1,2,1,"Table 8. Average judge score (mean ± std over repeats) for each temperature T and prompt, comparing four sampling methods on three base models. For each (T,prompt) and model, the best (highest mean) method is bolded; ties are bolded for all maxima. For details on each of the, Diversity, Originality, Narrative Flow, Emotional Impact check the Appendix. Across all 27 triplets, Min-p, top-p, and Top-H win 6, 5, and 5 cases respectively, while Top-W wins 12. (This experiment is done under β(T) = 1.5 + 1.5T while keeping the rest of parameters the same. In this experiment, β is higher than the default of this paper which is β = 2.8 and we can see that higher β can actually help depending on dataset and type of experiment such as when we value Diversity, Originality, Narrative Flow, Emotional Impact check, all together.)",143,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMR9|CMMI9|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMSY9,8.966,0,1,1,1,0,1,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,9.963,9.963,9.963,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
icml-2026-388e7825c92c,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,SFT-Text only、SFT-Interleaved、RL-Interleaved 在五类任务上的 Acc。,page_width,52.51|20.00|560.80|240.38,conceptual_diagram,1,2,1,"Figure 1 Illustration of challenges of geometric interleaved reasoning on several sub-tasks between SFT-Text only and SFT-Interleaved, which can only be tackled by RL post-training. However, existing training paradigms reveal a counterintuitive limitation [11–13]. While Supervised Fine- Tuning (SFT) on high-quality interleaved plot–solution data is expected to improve reasoning by providing richer multimodal context [14–16], our empirical results show the opposite effect. As shown in Figure 1, naively applying SFT to such interleaved traces leads to a significant performance drop compared to text-only baselines. Rather than acting as a scaffold, the insertion of plotting steps disrupts the reasoning process by forcing the model to alternate between logical deduction and code generation. We argue that this failure stems from a fundamental limitation of SFT. SFT primarily induces distributional alignment by minimizing",133,6,SFRM1000|SFRM0900|SFTI0900|ByteSans-Bold,9.963,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,SFRM1000|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|ArialMT|Arial-BoldMT,5.122,6.83,9.963,color,6,#A6CAEC|#46B1E1|#4E95D9|#C7DFF3|#3EA9DF|#4A81BA,0.6687,,,
