icml-2026-422971fda9c0,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,总览 procedural warm-up、semantic domains 与 layer transfer,page_width,36.89|20.00|560.56|195.48,pipeline|qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure 1. (Left) We pretrain language models on procedural data before exposing them to standard datasets of language, code, or mathematics. The procedural data is generated with simple algorithms and aims to teach elementary skills to aid the acquisition of semantic knowledge. (Right) This lightweight initial step speeds up standard pretraining and improves performance on diverse domains, with different pretrained layers (MLP vs. attention) contributing differently to each domain.",69,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal,8.966,0,0,1,1,0,0,2,DINAlternate-Bold|NimbusSanL-Regu|ArialNarrow|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI10,1.201,5.747,8.966,color,8,#E6F5FF|#9CACCB|#7CDABD|#F5BCA1|#7E8490|#BEE2DE|#9FBEC9|#E9F0F3,0.3759,,,
