icml-2026-44fb3b3b59c9,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 3,28,画出 tree plus CodeMDP hard instance、success/failure outcomes 和 D-steps blind action sequence。,page_width,36.89|20.00|559.44|316.97,tree|conceptual_diagram,1,2,1,"Figure 3. Illustration of hard instances for Theorem 3. The structure consists of a tree structure (top) and a CodeMDP (bottom). The leaf states are labeled l ,l ,l ,l . Each leaf state and action pair has its own probability distribution over the states in the CodeMDP. Once the 1 2 3 4 agent takes an action from the leaf state, it must make D(cid:101) actions without observing which state it has landed in. The agent enters the success state s succ if it landed at state (i,b) and the i-th out of D(cid:101) actions is b, and it receives the reward. The agent enters the fail state s fail if it landed at state (i,b) and the i-th out of D(cid:101) actions is not b, and it cannot receive any reward.",140,8,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|CMEX9|CMMI9|CMR6|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal,8.966,0,0,1,0,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMR9|CMR6|CMMI9|CMR7|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,5.978,8.966,14.346,color,8,#FFFDE9|#E8FFE7|#FFE6E6|#FFFDE8|#B7B4A9|#ECDFD7|#FFFFEC|#FEF5E9,0.2142,,,
