icml-2026-4e1dcbf5b839,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,1,并列比较 reconstruction、distillation/prior 与 LIMSSR，建立 full-modal training 假设差异。,single_column,311.00|58.11|588.00|364.99,other,3,2,1,"Figure 1. (a) Reconstruction-based and (b) Distillation/Prior-based incomplete multimodal learning methods typically rely on the un- realistic “full-modal training” assumption to generate missing data or distill priors. Incontrast, (c) ourLIMSSR leveragesthe context- aware reasoning capabilities of LLMs to infer latent semantics from available modalities under the more challenging Training- Time Incomplete Observations, eliminating the dependency on complete training data or reconstruction supervision.",63,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,8.966,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,TimesNewRomanPSMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|Calibri,1.559,6.315,14.346,color,8,#FFF3E5|#D8DFED|#BBBECA|#FFF3CF|#907D76|#F3D1AE|#E3E4ED|#FDF1D0,0.3153,,,
icml-2026-4e1dcbf5b839,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,3,展示 RGB/flow/audio、mask、projection、PCMI、LMRF、LLM、MDA 到 score 的全框架，并标示 Freeze/Trainable/Loss。,page_width,36.89|20.00|560.93|255.55,pipeline,1,1,1,"Figure 2. The overall framework of LIMSSR. Given incomplete data, LIMSSR first performs Prompt-Guided Context-Aware Modality Imputation, transforming available modalities into token sequences while using placeholders for missing ones. Guided by structured prompts, an LLM infers latent semantics for missing parts and consolidates multimodal information into fusion tokens. Finally, Mask- Aware Dual-Path Aggregation decodes these representations via uncertainty-calibrated reasoning and cross-modal pattern recovery paths, dynamically weighting them based on missingness states to generate robust scores.",75,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal,8.966,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,ComicSansMS|TimesNewRomanPSMT|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT|Calibri,1.269,4.949,10.131,color,8,#DCE3F0|#824564|#F1CECB|#FEF3CD|#BFCAD7|#E9F3E4|#FBF8E6|#C79EB3,0.3414,,,
