icml-2026-6b81cf37c92f,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 8,15,Bar charts vary gamma and lambda against an indicated teacher reference line.,page_width,36.89|20.00|560.56|191.92,line|bar,2,3,1,"Figure 8. Hyperparameter Sensitivity Analysis. We evaluate the impact of key hyperparameters on the average accuracy of the student model. (a) Varying the steering coefficient γ (on Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct): The method shows robustness across a wide range of γ values, consistently outperforming the Standard On-Policy Distillation baseline (dashed grey line). (b) Varying the language preservation weight λ (on Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct): A small non-zero regularization (e.g., λ = 0.01) yields the highest performance, confirming that the Language Preservation (LP) term effectively mitigates destructive interference without suppressing the visual signal.",87,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMMI9|CMR9,8.966,0,1,1,1,0,0,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,8.966,8.966,8.966,color,8,#1C219E|#CD43FF|#A56CC7|#131894|#4428A7|#D043FF|#1C209E|#1C219D,0.5038,,,
