icml-2026-7207f7ebdc88,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure A,14,smooth transition curves over s,page_width,36.89|248.00|560.56|554.88,qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure A. Illustrative output curves of our proposed smooth transition function f(·) with varying sharpness choices of s. As s increases, f(·) gradually transitions from a finite sequence of continuous mappings with increasing sharpness to a near-discrete ternary weight output in terms of the high-precision weight input, approximating a hard ternarization solution.",52,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMMI9|CMR9|CMSY9,8.966,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|DejaVuSans|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|DejaVuSans-Oblique|CMR10|CMMI10,4.361,9.963,9.963,color,8,#FF6464|#FF2020|#FFE0E0|#F5B0B0|#FF4A4A|#F47B7B|#761F1F|#FFD6D6,0.0706,,,
