icml-2026-756c559690e6,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,对比 people-loop 与 agent-loop，展示 expertise/algorithm/interaction barriers、四组件闭环、Top-k actions、score-based rollback 和 fully autonomous editing。,page_width,40.50|74.90|571.50|381.78,image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure 1. PhotoAgent autonomously performs high-level, semantically meaningful edits aligned with human aesthetic, moving beyond low-level color, contrast, or illumination tweaks. Upper-Left: People-loop, where users iteratively inspect the image, propose edits, and apply changes until satisfied. Upper-Right: PhotoAgent, where the process runs autonomously. Bottom: Edited photos. Note that PhotoAgent also supports user-guided editing (Fig. 6).",55,7,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,8.966,0,0,1,0,0,0,1,ComicSansMS|ComicSansMS-Bold|ComicSansMS-Italic|TimesNewRomanPSMT|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|DengXian-Bold,1.705,5.859,9.483,color,8,#513D38|#7E8A76|#C89658|#E5F5F7|#AA5840|#99C8DA|#EAC290|#FDE8E3,0.6756,,,
icml-2026-756c559690e6,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,4,把 Perceiver→MCTS Planner→heterogeneous Executor→Evaluator→rollback 的 main loop 与 reduced-resolution lightweight loop 放在一张 data-flow 图中。,page_width,40.50|20.00|571.50|273.35,image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure 2. Detailed loop of PhotoAgent. First, Perceiver extracts semantic cues from the current image and proposes N candidate editing actions. Second, Planner explores the candidate actions through iterative rollouts, scoring, and pruning to progressively refine edits and select the action that achieves the optimal result. Then, the executor applies these edits while the evaluator scores intermediate results, invoking re-planning when the score is unsatisfactory.",65,5,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI9,8.966,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,ComicSansMS|ComicSansMS-Bold|ComicSansMS-Italic|SegoeUISymbol|DengXian-Bold|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT,3.563,5.612,10.2,color,8,#C1DFE5|#F5EFDC|#F39888|#F6CA86|#445F6D|#7F96A0|#4A9996|#C67163,0.3609,,,
icml-2026-756c559690e6,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,experimental_design,main,Figure 3,6,展示 LAION/RealQA 来源、VLM-based relevance scoring、human verification、7k+ UGC-Edit 和 GRPO reward-model training pipeline。,page_width,40.50|20.00|571.50|242.51,pipeline|image_montage,1,2,1,"Figure 3. Pipeline for constructing the UGC-Edit Dataset and training reward model. We start with a diverse pool of source images from LAION [33] and RealQA [20]. Each image is processed through a structured prompt with Qwen3-VL [42] for UGC classification. The images are then filtered by human annotators. Finally, a reward model is trained via GRPO [34] to predict fine-grained quality scores.",63,6,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu,8.966,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,ComicSansMS|ComicSansMS-Bold,5.204,5.204,17.347,color,8,#A8EEF3|#DBBC96|#674F69|#6CC3BD|#8BE7EA|#87827B|#C3F1E1|#F1EBBE,0.434,,,
