icml-2026-c53ab491ce08,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,introduction,main,Figure 1,2,Contrasts reusable L2T compositions with entangled memorization.,page_width,36.89|20.00|559.44|195.01,pipeline|qualitative_grid,5,5,1,"Figure 1. Learning to Theorize (L2T) Framework. (a) Training data consists of observation pairs (x,y) generated by unobserved true programs. (b) Under L2T, the model learns to discover reusable primitives (Rotate, Left, Down, and Paint) and to compose them into executable theories. (c) Without L2T, the model instead memorizes entangled composite primitives (e.g., Left-Down) as indecomposed single units. (d) Once the model has learned to theorize, novel phenomena (e.g., Down-Paint-Rotate) can be explained by recombining learned primitives. (e) In contrast, memorized entangled representations fail to generalize to unseen programs.",92,7,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal|CMMI9|CMR9,8.966,0,1,1,0,0,0,2,NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,8.966,8.966,8.966,color,8,#D2D7B6|#6A7F8B|#E37A4A|#474F50|#97888D|#96D493|#6EC865|#B83C3A,0.1971,,,
icml-2026-c53ab491ce08,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,4,"Connects inference tokens, transitions, grounding, decoding, and MDL selection.",page_width,36.89|20.00|559.44|211.65,other,1,2,1,"Figure 2. Computation graph of Neural Theorizer (NEO). NEO infers a latent program by iteratively selecting a primitive z with the ik theory programmer q (z | s ,y) and executing it via the transition model p (s | s ,z ). Each intermediate state s is decoded ϕ ik k θ k+1 k ik k into a full reconstruction yˆ = D (s ); through state grounding (Sec. 3.4), these intermediate predictions are explicitly regularized to k θ k remain valid observations, preventing degenerate or blurry intermediate states. The MDL criterion selects the shortest accurate explanation length k∗ (green), which in turn provides a learning signal that favors short yet accurate program compositions (Sec. 3.3).",114,7,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi|CMMI9|CMMI6|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal,8.966,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,Aptos-Bold|NimbusRomNo9L-Medi,5.733,5.733,8.966,color,8,#E9F3FD|#DDEFDA|#C5D0CF|#FF871B|#E8FBE1|#B09B7D|#6CC36E|#BE6619,0.2903,,,
