icml-2026-ca6b03466916,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 27,57,Tracks zero-signal avoidance in GSM8K and maze.,page_width,52.87|46.07|542.41|372.40,other,1,1,1,"Figure 27: (Fraction of training tasks with non-zero pass rate) Extending the analysis from Figure 7 on large-scale LLM training, here we record the fraction of training tasks where the model generates at least one correct rollout on maze and SmolLM2-360M-Instruct training on GSM8K. We see the same trends as Figure 7, and MaxRL consistently outperforms both GRPO and RLOO, demonstrating MaxRL’s ability to generate better learning signal during training, as tasks with zero pass-rate contribute no gradients.",79,2,SFRM0800|SFBX0800|SFCC0800,7.97,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,SFRM1000|DejaVuSans|SFBX1000|SFCC1000|SFBX1200,1.846,9.963,11.955,color,8,#FF5B49|#71AE6B|#486F92|#8FB4A8|#BAC9BF|#6588A5|#E2E9EA|#D8D8D5,0.0615,,,
