icml-2026-d6b2488d4518,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,appendix,appendix,Figure 9,17,展示 high-entropy noise 改变措辞但保留正确答案、low-entropy noise 造成符号错误并级联失败的 qualitative traces。,page_width,36.89|83.74|559.44|390.62,qualitative_grid,1,2,1,"Figure 9. Qualitative examples of entropy-selective logit-noise perturbation. Injecting noise into low-entropy token predictions often introduces minor symbolic errors that cascade into incorrect final answers, whereas perturbations applied only to high-entropy token predictions typically preserve the final answer despite altering the surface form of the reasoning trace.",47,3,NimbusRomNo9L-Regu|NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal,8.966,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,TimesNewRomanPSMT|TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT|SegoeUISymbol,7.224,7.368,7.368,color,8,#9493E5|#C5BDFF|#EB9CB3|#8DC57B|#BA3B89|#F0E3F4|#F4CBD8|#CCDAD9,0.0478,,,
