icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 1,5,把 WFA 的 h_t=M_{x_t}h_{t-1} 画成 state t-1 到 state t 的加权路径聚合；建立后文 state-vector 直觉。,page_width,53.67|20.00|558.00|243.04,other,1,1,1,"Figure 1: Visualizing the Rational State Update. The hidden state vector h (right) is computed as a t linear transformation of the previous state h t−1 (left). Each component h t,i aggregates the weighted paths from the previous step, illustrating the ""sum of paths"" definition.",47,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|URWPalladioL-Bold|MnSymbol8,10.909,0,0,1,0,0,0,1,URWPalladioL-Ital|URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|NimbusSanL-Regu|MnSymbol8|MnSymbol10,4.981,7.97,10.909,color,8,#3F3FB2|#5454BB|#ADADDF|#CACAEB|#1D1DA4|#8C8CD1|#DCDCF3|#6565C2,0.1815,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 2,7,展示 input-driven WFA state 经 layer-specific W^(l) 投影，向所有 Transformer block 的 Deep Rational Injection。,page_width,53.66|71.23|559.91|378.11,architecture,1,1,1,"Figure 2: The Rational Transductor Architecture. The Rational Head extracts state variables h . t These states are injected into the Attention Stream via layer-specific projections W (l) , augmenting (l) the semantic hidden states z . t",35,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol8|URWPalladioL-Bold|CMSS10,10.909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NimbusSanL-Regu|URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol7|MnSymbol6|URWPalladioL-Bold,1.926,9.818,9.818,color,8,#FFF2E6|#E9ECE1|#4745D5|#8BBF9E|#B59189|#E5CAB7|#FFF1E5|#FFF6EB,0.3779,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 3,9,解释 Universal Rational Transductor 的 orthogonal 与 stochastic heads、concat 及 direct sum。,page_width,54.00|20.00|558.00|284.95,architecture,1,1,1,"Figure 3: The Universal Rational Transductor. The architecture instantiates parallel heads with distinct dynamical biases: Orthogonal (top) for infinite memory and Stochastic (bottom) for discrete switching. These independent features are concatenated, corresponding to the direct sum (⊕) of the underlying automata.",40,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,10.909,0,0,1,0,0,0,1,URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|NimbusSanL-Bold|NimbusSanL-Regu|MnSymbol7,3.633,7.97,10.909,color,8,#E6E6FF|#E6FFE6|#9AA1C3|#E6E6FE|#E4FDE4|#EBFFEB|#CFE6CF|#DCE0F1,0.4609,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,method,main,Figure 4,11,对照宽的 input-driven Rational Transductor 与深的 non-linear recurrence stack 的 dependency/parallelism。,page_width,53.64|20.00|559.91|236.12,qualitative_grid,2,3,1,"Figure 4: Architectural Comparison. (a) Wide Recurrence: The Rational Transductor computes a single high-dimensional state h directly from the input via a parallel scan, injecting it into all layers. t (b) Deep Recurrence: Stacked architectures (e.g., H3, Mamba) interleave recurrence, where Layer k depends on the output of Layer k −1, reintroducing a sequential bottleneck during training.",58,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,10.909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NimbusSanL-Regu|NimbusSanL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol7,5.978,8.966,8.966,color,8,#8882B6|#FFF2E6|#EBDCD5|#CCAA9A|#5455A9|#FDEFE3|#B5D4BD|#99727B,0.3407,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,table,theory,main,Table 1,13,以 task/property、Transformer、Transductor、theoretical reason 四列压缩表达语言能力边界。,page_width,53.66|113.66|558.00|365.10,table,1,1,1,Table 1: Theoretical comparison of capabilities between finite-depth Transformers and Rational Transductors. Transductors strictly expand expressivity to include all regular languages while sharing the fundamental limitation on context-free grammars.,29,2,URWPalladioL-Roma,10.909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|Dingbats|CMSS10|CMSS9,6.974,10.419,10.909,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 5,15,给出两状态 Parity WFA 与 modulo-3 cyclic counter，配合 Theorem 5–6 的 constructive proof。,page_width,54.00|20.00|558.00|229.43,other,2,2,1,"Figure 5: State tracking mechanisms for exact regular languages. (a) The Parity WFA uses a 2-state flip mechanism to track L . (b) The Modulo-3 WFA generalizes this to a cyclic group structure parity to solve L for k = 3. Input ‘0‘ acts as the Identity I (self-loop), while input ‘1‘ acts as a permutation. k",55,4,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10|CMSS10,10.909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital,7.97,9.963,10.909,color,8,#FFF2E6|#E0A060|#E5D0C5|#6F5A95|#FBEFE5|#FFF6EB|#FFF2E5|#B09BAB,0.3944,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 6,23,把 injected rational state 进入 Q/K 点积的二次 interaction 画成 virtual tensorization。,page_width,54.00|20.00|559.36|227.42,other,1,1,1,"Figure 6: Virtual Tensorization. By injecting the linear rational state h into the Attention mechanism, t the dot product QKT implicitly computes quadratic terms of the form h ⊺ t Mh t′. This effectively simulates a kernel over the tensor product space h t ⊗h t′, enabling the model to capture higher-order dependencies without explicitly materializing the O(d2) state space.",60,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10|MnSymbol6|MnSymbol8,10.909,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,MnSymbol10|NimbusSanL-Regu|URWPalladioL-Ital|NimbusSanL-Bold|MnSymbol7|URWPalladioL-Roma,5.38,8.966,8.966,color,8,#FCE1E2|#BD909F|#F1B1B4|#FFECEC|#A95D6E|#DB6F76|#F5CDCF|#FE3434,0.106,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 7,36,报告 Modulo-5 Counting 的长度泛化：RT 与 standard Transformer 的 accuracy。,page_width,53.64|315.87|558.00|622.75,other,1,2,1,"Figure 7: The Regular Gap (Modulo-5 Counting). The models are trained on short sequences (L = 50) and evaluated on longer lengths up to L = 500. The Standard Transformer (red) achieves high accuracy on the training distribution but fails to generalize, collapsing to near-random chance (20%) as length increases. The Rational Transductor (blue), leveraging the strictly orthogonal parameterization, learns the exact underlying automaton and maintains 100% accuracy across all tested lengths. Results are averaged over 5 random seeds; standard deviations are negligible (< 0.01%) and omitted for clarity (see Appendix B).",90,5,URWPalladioL-Roma|MnSymbol10|URWPalladioL-Ital,10.909,0,1,0,1,0,1,2,URWPalladioL-Roma|DejaVuSerif|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|CMSS10,3.442,10.909,10.909,color,8,#5D5DB1|#7474BB|#90293A|#E1D6EA|#C6B0D2|#1D1DD7|#7474E9|#5454F2,0.056,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 8,37,报告只训练 L=40 后，至 L=1000 的 Modulo-5 length generalization。,page_width,53.64|283.19|558.00|590.07,line,1,2,1,"Figure 8: Length Generalization. Models were trained only on sequences of length L = 40 (vertical dashed line) and evaluated on lengths up to L = 1000. The Standard Transformer (red) overfits to the training positions; its accuracy collapses to random chance (≈ 20%) on longer sequences. The Rational Transductor (blue) generalizes almost perfectly, maintaining 99% accuracy even at 25× the training length. This validates the algebraic exactness guarantee (Theorem 6). Shaded regions (invisible at this scale) denote standard deviation across 5 runs.",80,6,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,10.909,0,1,1,0,1,0,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|DejaVuSerif|URWPalladioL-Ital|DejaVuSans|MnSymbol10|MnSymbol8,3.155,10.909,10.909,color,8,#4949C8|#1211C1|#8D81C1|#D3C4DD|#771A3F|#B5A3CD|#E0D8EC|#E8E7FB,0.0475,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 9,39,比较 sequence mixing layer 的 latency 与 sequence length。,page_width,53.66|20.00|559.91|221.10,line,1,1,1,"Figure 9: Latency vs. Sequence Length. Wall-clock inference latency (ms) on a log-log scale. The Sequential RNN (red) scales linearly (O(T)), becoming prohibitively slow for long sequences. The Transformer (green) exhibits quadratic scaling (O(T2)), eventually running out of memory. The Rational Transductor (blue) leverages parallel associative scans to achieve sub-linear scaling, outperforming the RNN on sequences longer than T = 512 and maintaining high throughput even at T = 32k.",70,6,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,10.909,0,0,0,1,0,0,1,DejaVuSerif|DejaVuSans-Oblique,2.478,6.353,6.353,color,8,#202394|#5D9C5D|#1E741F|#896EA1|#823251|#D3D5D6|#AE96B7|#D8E0D9,0.2298,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 10,40,报告 long-integer addition 的 sequence-level exact-match accuracy。,page_width,54.00|39.60|558.01|346.48,architecture,1,2,1,"Figure 10: Experiment D: Long-Integer Addition. Sequence-level accuracy (exact match of the entire sum). The Standard Transformer (red) fits the training distribution (L = 20) but fails completely on longer sequences (0% at L = 100), unable to propagate carry bits over long distances. The Universal Rational Transductor (blue), leveraging a Stochastic head, learns the exact finite state automaton for addition. It generalizes perfectly to L = 1000 digits, demonstrating that the architecture can autonomously learn the correct switching logic for the task.",80,5,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,10.909,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,URWPalladioL-Roma|DejaVuSerif|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,3.478,10.909,10.909,color,8,#151594|#CACAE6|#C8969B|#931515|#D3B2B8|#A2505B|#E3D6DD|#891D2C,0.0628,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 11,41,比较 Base-2 Integer Evaluation 的 Float64 MSE。,page_width,53.66|193.14|559.36|500.02,other,1,1,1,"Figure 11: Quantitative Precision (Base-2 Evaluation). We trained models to compute the integer value of binary strings of length L = 64 using double precision. Standard architectures (LSTM, Transformer) fail completely (MSE ≈ 8.4×10 −2), collapsing to the random-guessing baseline. The Rational Transductor learns the exact affine recurrence, achieving near-perfect precision (MSE ≈ 5.9×10 −9).",56,4,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10|MnSymbol8,10.909,0,1,0,1,0,0,2,URWPalladioL-Roma|DejaVuSans|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10|URWPalladioL-Bold|MnSymbol8,2.168,10.909,10.909,color,8,#1A731A|#961A1A|#391664|#971E1E|#1A751A|#961818|#187318|#508A4F,0.322,,,
icml-2026-ef7b30eeedea,ICML,oral,foundation_200,table,appendix,appendix,Table 2,48,集中列出四项 synthetic task 的 architecture、optimization、sequence length、batch、learning rate、steps、loss 和 precision。,page_width,53.61|216.27|558.00|467.71,table,1,1,1,"Table 2 summarizes the configurations for all four synthetic tasks. Note that for the Long-Integer Addition task, we used a curriculum learning strategy where the training sequence length was sampled uniformly from U[10,40] at each step to encourage robust generalization.",42,2,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10,10.909,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|MnSymbol10|MnSymbol8,5.402,7.394,10.909,grayscale,0,,0.0,,,
icml-2026-f1190e536fe9,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,other,main,Unnumbered title-page conceptual graphic,1,把 good/bad arms、sloppy oracle、rate/fate 两种叙事路径压缩在 title page。,unknown,,other,1,1,0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
icml-2026-f1190e536fe9,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,results,main,Figure 1,2,展示 Python coding GRPO 在不同 J 下的 validation pass@1 trajectories、phase boundary 与 across-run uncertainty band。,page_width,53.67|20.00|559.25|261.53,other,1,2,1,"Figure 1: Phase transition under a sloppy oracle. We vary a single noise knob J, defined as J = 1 − δ − FP δ = TPR − FPR, which summarizes the net effect of false-positive and false-negative reward corruption FN induced by a noisy oracle. As J crosses zero, we observe a sharp transition from Phase I (learning; J > 0, accuracy improves with training and the bad-solution mass p for a prompt converges to 0) to Phase II (unlearning; J < 0, accuracy systematically degrades and p converges to 1), with J = 0 as the critical boundary. Curves report validation performance during GRPO training on a Python code-generation task (two epochs) starting from Qwen-2.5-3B; solid lines denote the run-averaged E[pass@1] and shaded bands",121,3,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|CMR10|CMSY10,9.963,1,1,0,1,1,0,3,SketchBlockLight,7.091,9.117,9.117,color,8,#FBD6D4|#F9EEDD|#FBD1D3|#E5E4E6|#E8D0C2|#A186B1|#C1BFCB|#DED9DC,0.4007,,,
icml-2026-f1190e536fe9,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 2,3,以 simplex vector paths 可视化 J positive/zero/negative 下 winner-take-all、fixed points 和 bad-arm outcome。,page_width,53.67|20.00|559.24|267.06,other,1,2,1,"Figure 2: The Winner Takes It All. The GRPO mean-field dynamics exhibit a striking structural property: in the absence of any symmetry among initial good arm masses, one arm ultimately dominates. When the oracle is in the learning regime (J = TPR − FPR > 0), the total bad-arm mass p(t) converges to 0, and among the good arms the algorithm converges to the one with the highest initial probability (see Appendix I for a rigorous theoretical analysis of this phenomenon.). At the critical boundary (J = 0), the probability vector remains fixed throughout training, yielding a continuum of equilibrium points. In the unlearning regime (J < 0), the flow reverses and the bad arm becomes the almost-sure winner. This “winner-take-all” behavior is an inherent feature of the GRPO-style replicator dynamics.",127,6,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Ital|URWPalladioL-Bold|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,1,0,0,1,0,1,1,MyriadPro-Regular|SketchBlockBold|SketchBlockLight|unknown,1.862,11.172,11.172,color,8,#D7E7EF|#F2E1E0|#AAA2A7|#B3CAD5|#EFE2C6|#965A65|#E8E1C2|#E8D2BE,0.2123,,,
icml-2026-f1190e536fe9,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 3,5,"将 mean-field prediction 概括为 learning/anti-learning 下 rate differs, fate same。",page_width,54.00|45.34|558.50|352.22,line,1,1,1,"Figure 3: Rate, not Fate. Our mean-field multi-armed bandit analysis predicts that, whenever learning succeeds (J > 0), training with noisy rewards asymptotically converges to the same final accuracy as training on clean rewards; the noise level controls only the convergence speed, not the eventual performance. The same phenomena happen for J < 0. Our mean field model, along with experimental observation in Fig. 1 supports the “convergence rate is different, fate is the same” prediction.",74,5,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|CMMI10,9.963,1,1,0,0,0,0,1,SketchBlockLight,8.104,10.13,10.13,color,8,#265386|#871E37|#3D7AB2|#CCC9D2|#FCF3E4|#C0424A|#A1273C|#B98E96,0.6894,,,
icml-2026-f1190e536fe9,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 4,11,解释 softmax Jacobian、tangent space 与 Shahshahani/Fisher geometry。,page_width,53.58|20.00|559.25|214.87,other,1,2,1,"Figure 4: Geometry of the Probability Simplex. The policy p evolves on the non-Euclidean manifold ∆K+M−1. The softmax Jacobian J(p) endows this space with the Shahshahani (Fisher) geometry, projecting updates onto the zero-sum tangent space T . GRPO induces a mass-conserving replicator flow, p˙ = ηJ(p)A, p which dynamically redistributes probability mass based on relative advantage. In the local tangent space, the forward KL divergence manifests as the quadratic form 1δ⊤Diag(p)−1δ, identifying J(p) as the inverse 2 Riemannian metric.",86,5,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|CMR10|URWPalladioL-Ital|CMSY10,9.963,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,,,,,color,8,#C3A5AF|#DFC6C7|#F4E1CB|#9F7669|#F7EDE0|#F3DBC1|#B8BECB|#EDE6DB,0.3387,,,
icml-2026-f1190e536fe9,ICML,spotlight,foundation_200,figure,theory,main,Figure 5,17,显示 KL anchoring 把 J=0 boundary collapse 转成 interior equilibrium。,page_width,54.00|20.00|559.25|266.01,other,1,2,1,"Figure 5: KL regularization smooths the phase transition at J = 0 via an interior fixed point. Incorporating a KL penalty toward a reference mass p introduces a restoring drift, resulting in the regularized ODE ref equation 18. For any β > 0, the system possesses a unique stable interior equilibrium p⋆ ∈ (0,1) defined by the balance condition equation 19. This equilibrium satisfies p⋆ < p for J > 0, p⋆ = p at J = 0, ref ref and p⋆ > p for J < 0. The reward-driven component is modulated by the multi-block collision factor ref C(y,z) = ∥y∥2 + ∥z∥2 ∈ [1/K + 1/M,2]. As β → ∞, the equilibrium approaches p due to strong 2 2 ref ↓",115,5,URWPalladioL-Roma|URWPalladioL-Bold|URWPalladioL-Ital|CMR10|CMMI10,9.963,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,,,,,color,8,#2670AE|#B72D33|#C2DDEB|#74AFD1|#E47E64|#EAB097|#F9EFDC|#F8D8C6,0.7848,,,
